  "notes": "v3.08.0: 🧊 PREMIUM UI + NEW WHATSAPP API (user: 'ඔකෙ flows ටික ලස්සනට premium look එකකින් · අලුත්ම whatsapp api · v3.08 ලොකුම ලොකු වෙනසක් · ai වලින් හැදුවා කියලා හදුන ගන්න බැරි වෙන්න'). ① ui.js — NEW premium UI engine on Baileys 7 native interactive cards (the newest WA API): single_select tap-lists + cta_url buttons via proto.Message.InteractiveMessage + prepareWAMessageMedia — every card goes through the normal send wrapper (pace + out-guard + dedupe); parseTap() unwraps interactiveResponseMessage taps and routes them like typed commands (zero duplicate flow logic). ② INTERACTIVE-FIRST PANELS: .menu / .setting / .mode now send ONE native card — deck-photo media header + live status body + '📂 Categories/⚙️ Options/🛡️ Modes' tap-list (option values live in row titles) → tap = command runs; classic photo+caption card = automatic fallback (interactive fail can NEVER break a flow, SOCK-uploader guard + try/catch everywhere). ③ MOVIEX PREMIUM: search → ONE ＭＯＶＩＥＤＥＸ ʀᴇsᴜʟᴛs tap-card (poster-style header, top-3 preview, ≤20 rows native list, >20 keeps full text list too) replaces the number list; movie card → poster media-header interactive card with quality+subtitle tap rows (sizes in descriptions) — tap 720p = download starts; sessions/setUi ring routing unchanged (WYSIWYG numbering). ④ style.js premium kit: THIN divider ⌯━━━⌯ · sm() small-caps · sect() ╭─〈 ᴛɪᴛʟᴇ 〉─╮ — .keys + .moviedex usage cards rebuilt; one shared visual language, hand-made look. ⑤ moviedex ctx += ui/upload — bot.js passes SOCK.waUploadToServer; interactive header media upload 12s timeout. tests: NEW test_v3080 (tap parse + sections chunking + cta + fail-safe + full WAMessage e2e build/encode-decode round-trip + wiring), all suites re-pinned 3.07.0→3.08.0, pkg+lock 3.08.0; updater REPO arena-ai-wa-bot-render unchanged — bot auto-update මෙතනින්ම",
